[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なぁ結華、少し雑談をいいか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00128",
    "bgm": "029"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いつから許可制になったのー？\r\n遠慮なくどうぞですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あのさ。今回のことで、\r\nみんなの気持ちが聞けたの、嬉しかったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんな対俺って意味でも、みんな対みんなって意味でも、\r\n前より踏み込めたんじゃないかって思ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから……えーと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……それ、みんなにかこつけて三峰個人に言ってるでしょ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたんはさぁ……\r\n人の繊細なところを遠慮なくぶち抜いてくるよねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それ、二回目だな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "言ったのは二回目～\r\nでも思ったのはそれだけで済むかな～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うっ……すまん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、まぁヘコまないでよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──三峰はねー、割とそういうの、\r\n困っちゃうなぁって感じるタイプだと思ってるわけ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "知られたくないものは知られたくないし、\r\n見せたくないものとか絶対隠しておきたい",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもねぇ、人にそのスタンス取られると",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『強がってるのなんか丸わかりだから早く吐きなさい！』\r\nって気持ちがするんだなぁって、今回、わかっちゃった",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……まったく厄介だよねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華、それは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……歩み寄り宣言、か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えー？\r\n三峰、難しいことわかんな～い",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……とかは冗談としても\r\n歩み寄りなんて人聞き悪いよね、人が離れてるみたいにさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そういうつもりじゃなくてだな……！\r\n……もっと頼ったりしてくれたら嬉しいなと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今でも結構頼ってるのになー？\r\n三峰、甘えのパラメーターに極振りなのになー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……誤魔化そうとしてるだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……えへへ\r\nそういうとこわかってくれるから好きよ、Ｐたん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、納得してない顔だ\r\nほんっと頑固～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもまぁ、プラスに考えてくれればさ？\r\nＰたんは三峰のそういうとこ見抜けるわけで",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……三峰も、見抜かれることを許してるわけで",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今はそれで一旦おっけーしてほしいなー、なんて\r\n思ったりしちゃいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007002020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そんな感じで、どう？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700202/1007002020220"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]